      "evidence_source": "Participants completed the Body and Appearance Self-Conscious Emotions Scale (BASES; Castonguay, Sabiston, Crocker, &amp; Mack, 2014; Polish translation: Stachyra, Razmus, &amp; Razmus, 2017), which measures four body-related emotions: shame, guilt, hubristic pride, and authentic pride. Here, the BASES demonstrated adequate internal consistency (\u02db= .87 for Shame, \u02db= .81 for Guilt, \u02db= .91 for Hubristic pride, and \u02db= .91 for Authentic pride).",
